# Policy:
#
# 1. ignore only 'top level dot folders'
#
# 2. we define 'top level dot folder' as:
#    - a leading forward slash `/`
#    - followed by dot `.`
#    - followed by a lowercase alphabetic name
#    - ending with a forward slash `/`
#
# 3. reasons to ignore a 'top level dot folder':
#    - it is autogenerated
#    - it contains local user config
#    - it is scratch space

# autogenerated folders, which contain local user config
/.agents/
/.codex/

# local user config
/.vscode/

# scratch space
/.tmp/
